  'Kỹ sư phần mềm cấp cao (Senior Developer)': { en: 'Senior Software Engineer (Senior Developer)', zh: '高级软件工程师（Senior Developer）', ja: 'シニアソフトウェアエンジニア（Senior Developer）', ko: '시니어 소프트웨어 엔지니어(Senior Developer)', es: 'Ingeniero de software sénior (Senior Developer)', fr: 'Ingénieur logiciel senior (Senior Developer)', de: 'Senior-Softwareentwickler (Senior Developer)', th: 'วิศวกรซอฟต์แวร์อาวุโส (Senior Developer)', id: 'Insinyur perangkat lunak senior (Senior Developer)' },
  'Trưởng nhóm Đảm bảo chất lượng (QA Lead)': { en: 'Quality Assurance Lead (QA Lead)', zh: '质量保证负责人（QA Lead）', ja: '品質保証リード（QA Lead）', ko: '품질 보증 리드(QA Lead)', es: 'Líder de aseguramiento de calidad (QA Lead)', fr: 'Responsable assurance qualité (QA Lead)', de: 'Leitung Qualitätssicherung (QA Lead)', th: 'หัวหน้าทีมประกันคุณภาพ (QA Lead)', id: 'Pimpinan Penjaminan Mutu (QA Lead)' },
